"1680":193,"1681":1427,"1682":895,"1683":1576,"1684":997,"1685":1303,"1686":822,"1687":716,"1688":589,"1689":890,"1690":1124,"1691":1285,"1692":470,"1693":879,"1694":1300,"1695":901,"1696":1247,"1697":249,"1698":164,"1699":1673,"1700":525,"1701":1419,"1702":1429,"1703":1587,"1704":1632,"1705":1609,"1706":370,"1707":900,"1708":1629,"1709":1268,"1710":1345,"1711":847,"1712":1577,"1713":896,"1714":1125,"1715":897,"1716":515,"1717":899,"1718":1127,"1719":848,"1720":880,"1721":898,"1722":1430},"orderedDocs":[[1122,"—"],[1131,"—"],[1137,"—"],[346,"**`<Text slot=\"label\">`** — any `Text` child with `slot=\"label\"` has its `id` linked to the button via `aria-labelledby`. This is the recommended way to provide a contextual label that is also visible to sighted users."],[347,"**`aria-label`** — pass `aria-label` on the `DropZone` component to override or supplement the label (e.g. `aria-label=\"Upload profile photo\"`). When no `Text slot=\"label\"` is present and no `aria-label` is set, the button falls back to the default \"DropZone\" label provided by React Aria."],[1069,"**`ButtonGroup`** — a cluster of related actions, typically inside a `Footer` (an end-aligned, wrapping row with `role=\"group\"`)."],[1066,"**`Content`** — the primary body region (a `<section>`, a column that grows to fill)."],[366,"**`Field`** — stacks a field's label, control, description, and error in one consistently spaced column (pure layout — a `Flex` column with the standard field gap)."],[371,"**`FieldButton`** — an actionable control placed inside the box, such as the NumberField steppers or a search submit (a click target within the group)."],[373,"**`FieldDescription`** — helper text that explains the field; renders nothing when empty (wraps the antares `Text` with `slot=\"description\"`)."],[374,"**`FieldError`** — surfaces the field's validation messages when it is invalid, and nothing when valid (a thin wrapper over React Aria `FieldError`)."],[368,"**`FieldGroup`** — the bordered box that visually unites a field's controls and reflects their shared focus, disabled, and invalid state. Used only by \"boxed\" fields (TextField, NumberField, Select, DateField); presentationally it is a React Aria `Group`."],[369,"**`FieldInput`** — the single-line control the user types into (a normalized React Aria `Input` given antares spacing via `Box`)."],[367,"**`FieldLabel`** — names the field and flags whether it's required (wraps React Aria `Label`, rendering an optional `*` indicator)."],[370,"**`FieldTextArea`** — the multiline control the user types into (a normalized React Aria `TextArea` given antares spacing via `Box`)."],[372,"**`FieldTrigger`** — a full-width value-display button inside the box that opens an overlay (used by Select and DatePicker): a value area plus a trailing icon, laid out across the group. `variant=\"select\"` is transparent and input-like; `variant=\"control\"` is a filled segment inside a shared group."],[1068,"**`Footer`** — the bottom region: secondary content and/or actions (a `<footer>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[1067,"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[471,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[470,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[478,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[479,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[477,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1253,"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize."],[845,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[458,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[1429,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[463,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1072,"**Adopted** — placed inside a parent that provides its context (`ContentContext`, `HeaderContext`, `FooterContext`, `ButtonGroupContext`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Merge precedence is defaults \\< parent context \\< consumer props (`className` concatenates, handlers chain), via React Aria's `useContextProps`."],[1207,"**Adornments**: Optional `leadingText` and `trailingText` for fixed text before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`)"],[1251,"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."],[891,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1310,"**Arrow Left / Right**"],[1016,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[616,"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a submenu"],[728,"**Arrow Up** / **Arrow Down** (or **Up** / **Down**): increase or decrease by `step`"],[615,"**Arrow Up/Down**: move between items; **Home/End**: first/last"],[892,"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"],[1445,"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"],[455,"**Automatic caching**: Once loaded, icons are cached for optimal performance"],[510,"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"],[1441,"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"],[1440,"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"],[460,"**Bento integration**: Extends Bento Icon with additional Antares-specific features"],[1443,"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"],[1334,"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."],[1575,"**Chart container:** `data-width`, `data-height`, `data-x-labels`, `data-y-labels`, `data-x-labels-vertical`, `data-x-baseline`, `data-y-baseline`, `data-x-tick-marks`, `data-y-tick-marks`"],[534,"**Check browser console**: Look for network errors"],[1479,"**Check container**: Ensure the chart container is not transformed or positioned in a complex layout"],[1474,"**Check data**: Ensure `series` array has data and `xAccessor`/`yAccessor` return valid values"],[1476,"**Check dimensions**: Ensure container has non-zero width and height"],[1475,"**Check domains**: Verify `yDomain` (if set) includes your data values"],[532,"**Check icon name**: Ensure the icon exists in the CDN"],[1478,"**Check scroll position**: The component accounts for horizontal scroll automatically"],[186,"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[185,"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[518,"**Client-Side Hydration**: The sprite sheet is generated and injected after hydration, causing a brief paint event"],[457,"**Color inheritance**: Uses `currentColor` by default for seamless theme integration"],[635,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[364,"**Composition primitives.** The field components (TextField, NumberField, DateField, Select, RadioGroup, CheckboxGroup) compose these internally — reach for those first. These primitives are also the building blocks for custom composite fields, e.g. an input and a select sharing one bordered box."],[529,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[633,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[1043,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1208,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1252,"**Controls keep their own type.** A `Button` inside a lockup is sized by its own `size` prop,\nnot the lockup's."],[1633,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[1427,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[1426,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[1483,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[517,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[1424,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[519,"**DOM Output:**"],[1316,"**End**"],[192,"**errorMessage**: Displays validation error text below the group"],[464,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[535,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[523,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[508,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[456,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1045,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[511,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1442,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1454,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1314,"**Home**"],[730,"**Home** / **End**: jump to `minValue` or `maxValue` when those props are set"],[1457,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1446,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[1632,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[1623,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[486,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[526,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[1425,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[191,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[190,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[1449,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[1041,"**Label, description, error**: Optional label, helper text, and error message with proper accessibility"],[1206,"**Label, description, error**: Optional label, helper text, and error message with proper accessibility"],[634,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1333,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[1482,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[522,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[1444,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[539,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[1448,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1209,"**Multiline**: Set `multiline` to render a textarea instead of a single-line input"],[533,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[844,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[454,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[729,"**Page Up** / **Page Down**: larger increase or decrease when supported"],[520,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[537,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[530,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[888,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[887,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[636,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1046,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[1211,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria TextField for accessibility and behavior"],[1660,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[521,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[516,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[1423,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[1455,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1335,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (