ins visible during horizontal scroll"],[465,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[509,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[1308,"**Tab**"],[196,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[890,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1015,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1248,"**The body is a bare `<Text>`.** `slot=\"description\"` is equivalent, for consistency with\n`Field` and `Modal`."],[1249,"**The eyebrow is `slot=\"eyebrow\"`**, on either a `Text` or a `Tag`. The two forms swap\nfreely, and a `Tag` is sized to pair with the lockup."],[1250,"**The title is a `Heading`.** Pick the level from the document outline, not the visual size:\n`size` handles the visuals, so `<Heading level={1}>` in an `xs` lockup is perfectly valid."],[846,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles truncate. Shorten the title."],[1304,"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1303,"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"],[1462,"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-aware calculations for accurate placement"],[1451,"**Tooltips**: Show on both hover and focus for keyboard users"],[524,"**Trade-offs:**"],[466,"**Transform**: `rotate`, `flip` for icon transformations"],[617,"**Type to select**: jump to a matching item (string labels are used as `textValue`)"],[1634,"**Typed Refs:** Refs are correctly typed based on the `as` value - `useRef<HTMLButtonElement>` works with `as=\"button\"`."],[459,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[1430,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[1698,"**Use `Grid` when**: You need explicit two-dimensional layouts with rows and columns, named grid areas, or responsive auto-fill patterns."],[527,"**Use default mode** for SSR applications or when icons appear infrequently"],[